{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_10_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a550e4a501c349bff378e41953e5c77023cfee0e63e34748c45fd70ae1cd0f25",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14fff86eb22414fb57600d8331e9863a9bfcb7d6d79d9dba566d38bbb44ffa06",
      "text": "总算赶到休息室了呢。\n在演出开始前，快换上演出服吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39cc817f8d68c152f16c3211b60341cdc81ce04718de08e9a8581bd838b7f928",
      "text": "哎呀，服装上别着个相当可爱的小玩意呢？\n这是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d278ab439c6efb011956367f3303ccf20d842e93d24d7cb897da42fc0526a2a1",
      "text": "啊哈哈……这是我自己准备的对策之一。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6e1bc9b77c510ed91805d763bf28ff09af699c06eb0cbf1ab1e809cb005510a",
      "text": "送给在男极期间坚持努力的我们自己。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b2ba956cf7d96ac982e02264da363e50e4eb6a20f85ced60ba419cedf50a778",
      "text": "为了嘉奖这份拼搏、鼓舞士气，\n亲手制作的“奖励奖牌”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000151:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45ca4a868d7fe35bfd457aedcf5897ab440225fa952c263bd343798eaf2c7b21",
      "text": "哇，正中间还写了字。\n我看看，“男极”……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000160:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e041b2a04001c8e3adb3c86a740370361f60f72e545896b1ab8ba99243e585d",
      "text": "“男极FIVE”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000163:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab4ebef2f37c60513dea37554da74ac65bf6cc0c52bb49b3fa86d1dab0a832a5",
      "text": "因为不能写“男极KING”，所以我想了个替代的\n称号，并和制作人商量了一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000167:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1d517ab3d5954d781c34d1c60744790d52de263fdfa993a7f6a621be11f4baa",
      "text": "感觉像英雄战队的名字一样，很帅气吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000174:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a55cb64fee4e6179bdab567f742a516fd45850574bf59d7a93e2cb4c3df1e962",
      "text": "要是演出服又没送达，\n我本来还打算从零开始做一套的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000180:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:526f5e1730a4c4fff7b3cc7a1989cbdaed9003c10312bd4fcdeee8191cec656a",
      "text": "幸好没用上，真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000208:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00b437fe9c0f44a27eb593c92ac5d5227c3b1e6fc0e5af2510f98f202e3ef3df",
      "text": "啊哈哈，所以诚司刚才才穿着围裙啊？\n真的是，这5个人也太靠得住啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000227:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e72b612a1a391ac0e139c86a3b10afbd0111137731d71c1877c52701d03addba",
      "text": "LIVE会场",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000233:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bae5c5462c685fc917f103b9c2eb59b001653591ce50674f64261fb6325c74b8",
      "text": "哎呀，气氛越来越热烈了！\n那么现在，请下一组出演者登场吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000235:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78469b869fda6aa9b35216a88b46db37227e7d790fff585bed52dab782b9ffff",
      "text": "在男极联赛中，既不是男极KING……也不是别的什么，\n而是男极优秀奖？男极努力奖？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000239:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02698a19872b30c3dd14f9e1bf1b0a0f605144b1578d586465a4dadf6983db01",
      "text": "荣获了这般奖项的，正是315 Production的各位～！\n咦，怎么迟迟不上台呢？是迟到了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000247:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78073b7bb426b00424ab6e96d7d54c83b49f0ce499e5fa90be073f0e8f0175b1",
      "text": "（呵呵呵，这帮家伙怎么可能上得了台！\n现在肯定还在为我准备的重重妨碍苦苦挣扎呢……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000259:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6aa71adba142539128d582d21c011dc147e3137a0bc608a3b4be75e7914f9391",
      "text": "我们的话，就在这里哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_10:1_4_002_10_h:cmd-000271:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8ce9639f364d6b79385b85499b3103c1a4a13132c74f1b400f8eb2ccff67a78",
      "text": "什、什么！？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
